Using the AtlasReadoutEvidenceBrief_v0_1 payload below, produce the first post-survey Atlas Landing readout.

Prioritize:
- clear evidence hierarchy;
- strongest signal first;
- concrete examples;
- cautious confidence language;
- explicit uncertainty where evidence is mixed;
- short, app-ready copy.

The readout should feel like a smart analyst explaining what Cartenza sees so far.

Return JSON only using the shared output schema.

