Using the AtlasReadoutEvidenceBrief_v0_1 payload below, create UI-ready copy for an Atlas Landing screen.

Think in sections:
1. short opening read;
2. signal cards;
3. song-shape summary from affinity tags;
4. uncertainty cards;
5. bridge into the first missions.

Prioritize scannability, short sections, and clear hierarchy. Avoid long paragraphs. Each card should have a distinct job.

Return JSON only using the shared output schema.

