Using the AtlasReadoutEvidenceBrief_v0_1 payload below, produce a post-survey Atlas Landing readout that gives special attention to the positive song-affinity rollup.

The readout should explain not only which regions of music are appearing, but what kinds of songs inside those regions are working:
- sonic texture;
- vocal performance;
- rhythm/body;
- form/container;
- emotional theme.

Use the affinity tags carefully. They are early pattern evidence, not final truth.

Return JSON only using the shared output schema.

